","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-21T12:47:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T00:47:54Z","closed_at":"2026-09-22T19:09:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123672","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123672","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123672.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123672.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-22T19:09:50Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes a bug where the joypad touchpad info doesn't get cleared after the joypad gets disconnected, which lead to bugs such as `Input.get_joy_num_touchpads()` returning `1` even if the joypad is disconnected or it doesn't have touchpads at all.\r\n\r\nHow to reproduce the bug on `master`:\r\n1. Connect a controller with a touchpad (DualShock 4/DualSense controllers), notice that `Input.get_joy_num_touchpads()` returns `1`\r\n2. Disconnect it, notice that `Input.get_joy_num_touchpads()` still returns `1` even though the controller is disconnected\r\n3. Connect a controller without a touchpad, notice that `Input.get_joy_num_touchpads()` still returns `1`\r\n\r\nI can confirm this change fixes the issue for me on Windows with my DualShock 4 controller.\r\n\r\n- The bug was originally reported in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/pull/1354\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nNo AI was used.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123672/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123672/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}